{"synopsis":"Setelah Ter-Isekai ke novel harem, Lin Xiao menjadi senior yang jahat dari sekte Azure Mist! Dengan mengikuti alur cerita aslinya dan menjadi penjahat yang menyebalkan, dia akhirnya bisa mendapatkan hadiah menajadi Immortal! karena tidak punya pilihan lain, dia menjalan tugasnya sebagai penajahat dengan hati-hati. Dia terpaksa menggoda junior keempatnya, mencuri pakaian junior ketiganya, dan menambahkan obat ke minuman junior keduanya. Akhirnya, hari dimana sang protagonis Ye Chen Bergabung dengan sekte pun tiba! Lin Xiao sangat bersemangat dan bersiap untuk meracuni protagonis.","alternative_title":"反派大师兄，师妹们全是病娇, Fǎnpài Dà Shīxiōng, Shīmèimen Quán Shì Bìng Jiāo, Fanpai Da Shixiong, Shimeimen Quan Shi Bing Jiao, The Big Villain Brother and the Junior Sisters Are All Sick and Delicate, The Great Villain Senior Brother and All of His Yandere Junior Sisters, El Gran Villano Hermano Mayor y todas sus Hermanas Menores Yandere, Nhân Vật Phản Diện Đại Sư Huynh, Tất Cả Các Sư Muội Đều Là Bệnh Kiều, Nhân Vật Phản Diện Đại Sư Huynh, Tất Cả Các Sư Muội Đều Là Yandere, Старший брат-наставник - лиходій, а молодші сестри-наставниці ціловито божевільні","author":"Pikapi (噼咔噼)","artist":"Pikapi (噼咔噼)","chapters":[{"number":"170","chapter":"170","slug":"62664f82-4fa9-4cf6-ade2-fe5fea864706","title":"Chapter 170","date":"2026-02-08"},{"number":"169","chapter":"169","slug":"18b00bad-fbea-4569-8162-29d87cf8639c","title":"Chapter 169","date":"2026-01-29"},{"number":"168","chapter":"168","slug":"5b67c1fe-ecc8-489a-8863-99728e368a21","title":"Chapter 168","date":"2026-01-21"},{"number":"167","chapter":"167","slug":"778b1ab9-97db-4e37-af79-40375067ba11","title":"Chapter 167","date":"2026-01-12"},{"number":"166","chapter":"166","slug":"4dd6f524-dd53-4544-b7b3-1baf1168edd4","title":"Chapter 166","date":"2025-12-26"},{"number":"165","chapter":"165","slug":"ae30f554-d482-4060-8509-5aa163b338f8","title":"Chapter 165","date":"2025-12-07"},{"number":"164","chapter":"164","slug":"381